# 29. Supabase RLS

RLS is mandatory.

Examples:

### Customer

Customer can:

```text
SELECT own profile
SELECT own orders
SELECT own order history
SELECT own invoices
SELECT own payments
```

Customer cannot:

```text
SELECT another customer's orders
UPDATE another customer's order
SELECT drivers
SELECT admin data
```

### Driver

Driver can:

```text
SELECT own profile
SELECT assigned orders
UPDATE allowed delivery status
INSERT delivery proof
```

Driver cannot:

```text
View unrelated customer data
View all orders
Change pricing
Change payment records
Manage drivers
```

### Admin

Admin can manage operational records.

Never bypass RLS simply because the UI hides something.

